  The remote: a square Room Summary Card beside the house's, shaped the same
  way. The card and its media icon open the page of the Home button named in
  'page'. 'extras' are plain icons after the counted ones: no count badge,
  tap toggles. An extra may be a mapping instead ({entity_id, icon, link,
  count}): 'link' names the Home button whose page it opens; 'count' names an
