{#-
  Holiday lighting (packages/holiday/): a square Room Summary Card beside the
  others, shaped the same way. Its background is sensor.holiday_lighting's
  picture (the current holiday's). Two icons (tap toggles): the accent lights
  on/off (the great room ambiance group), and the indoor holiday scene (the
  accent lights in the current holiday's colors). The card opens the Holiday
  view: the Holiday section, split into 'indoor' and 'outdoor' tiles ({entity,
  name, state_content}; one with 'holiday' shows only during that holiday,
  per sensor.holiday_lighting), then the 'rooms' and their lights (the accent
  lights, the living room lamps and the TV backlight; a light is an entity_id,
  or {entity, name} to rename it on the card).
  Its title follows the holiday (holiday_title, an HA template):
  sensor.seasonal_accent_lights' current_holiday_name (Mood Lighting when
  there is none).
-#}
